<title>NETHERLANDS: Heineken shares expected sharply down.</title>
<headline>Heineken shares expected sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share analysts said on Friday they saw the shares of brewer Heineken NV falling as much as 25 guilders from Thursday's 362.70 guilder closing after lower than expected first half results and a profit warning.</p>
</text>
